    "text": "3.5 years ago I went to my first Brandi Carlile show. What I was experiencing was so amazing that I wanted to document it in photos. I’d never really taken concert photos before.\n\nA year ago, I shot my first show- Brandi Carlile at Red Rocks. I wasn’t a photographer. I’d never even used this new camera. But they let me try.\n\nThis week, I started working full time for Brandi Carlile and next week I go on tour 📸 \n\nIt’s wild how I can trace it back to those little iPhone 12 pics from the front row",
